  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Ŋakiro A Ŋirwa 18",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Todwar Mikaia atemar ilounio Yeosapat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeosapat toyakaunor ebari ŋolo alalan nooi ka abu torwoniar nooi. Apotu iŋes tocamunos ka Aab atemar kiitanakin ŋituŋa a ŋikalya kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋikaru a ŋice, abu Yeosapat totiyaar tolot apeyo neni ka Aab Samaria. Toar Aab ŋamesekin ka ŋaatuk ŋuna alalak aŋuna a Yeosapat ka ŋituŋa ŋulu arukitotor, kimaima Aab Yeosapat akirem Ramos-Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋit Aab erwosit a Isirael Yeosapat erwosit a Yudaya tema, “Ipedori iyoŋ arukor ka ayoŋ akitijiore Ramos-Gilead a?” Toboŋok Yeosapat tema, “Ikirae iwon ŋipei, erae ŋituŋa kaŋ ŋulu kon, ikimorikin isua ka iyes alojie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu daŋ Yeosapat tema neni a erwosit a Isirael, “Kiŋitu mono ŋuna ebala Ekapolon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu erwosit a Isirael tonyarau ŋikadwarak ŋulu arae ekimar ŋamiae ŋaomwon; kiŋit ikes tema, “Ikilosi akitijiore ŋituŋa a Ramos-Gilead, kori nyikilosi?” Toboŋokis ikes temasi, “Apesi kitipeiyosi, anerae einakini Akuj Ramos-Gilead neni ke erwosit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Yeosapat kiŋit erwosit a Isirael tema, “Mam mono ekadwaran ece eyai ne ŋolo epedorere iwon akiŋitunia ŋakiro aneni ke Ekapolon a?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok erwosit a Isirael Yeosapat tema, “Eyai nabo ekile epei, ŋolo epedorere iwon akiŋitunia ŋuna ebala Ekapolon, erae ekiro keŋ Mikaia, lokoku a Imela. Nai nyacamit ayoŋ ekile ŋol, anerae nyedwarenene iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna eketalakarito ayoŋ, edwarenene ŋuna a ŋican bon.” Tema Yeosapat, “Nyemaikina erwosit irworo ŋakiro ŋuna ikote ŋun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyarau nai erwosit a Isirael epei a ŋikapolok a akwap keŋ, tema, “Yau atipei Mikaia lokoku a Imela laalo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, anapito erwosit a Isirael ka Yeosapat erwosit a Yudaya ŋilowi kec ŋulu ka apolou, kiboiyete analapatu a ŋina alotooma epuke ŋolo ke etaun alokicoloŋo kec a ŋulu ka apolou. Ayai alapatu ŋin lopuke ke etaun Samaria, ido apotu ŋikadwarak daadaŋ todwara a nen alokiŋaren kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, keris Sedekia lokoku a Kenaana kitiyau ŋamomwar a ŋasuwa, ido abu iŋes tema, “Ebala Ekapolon, ‘A ŋamomwar a nu, itiji iyoŋ ŋituŋa ka Aram akitodol ŋina imunyarya.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikadwarak ŋuluce daadaŋ todwara ŋakiro ŋunapei ŋun temasi, “Ape, kitijik ŋituŋa a Ramos-Gilead, ireuni iyoŋ ikes, anerae einakini Ekapolon Ramos Gilead neni kon a erwosit.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema ekiyakia ŋolo eyakitae anyarare Mikaia neni a Mikaia ebe, “Kiira nu, ikwaan ŋakiro ŋuna erwor ŋikadwarak ŋuluce, erae ŋuna italakarito erwosit, kirwor iyoŋ daŋ ŋakiro ŋuna ikwaan ka ŋuna kec, ŋuna italakarito erwosit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Mikaia tema neni keŋ, “Ikwapei eyarya Ekapolon, erwori ayoŋ ŋuna akalimokini ayoŋ Akuj kaŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoluni Mikaia neni ke erwosit, kiŋit erwosit iŋes tema, “Mikaia, elosyo isua akitijiore ŋituŋa a Ramos-Gilead, kori nyikilosi?” Toboŋok Mikaia iŋes tema, “Apesi kitipeiyosi kitijikis ikes kilout; einakini Ekapolon Ramos-Gilead neni a erwosit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu erwosit kiŋit iŋes tema, “Ŋakisikoŋiet ŋayai emaikina ayoŋ ekesikoŋ iyoŋ, ikotere ikilimok iyoŋ ayoŋ ŋuna a kire alokiro ke Ekapolon?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai Mikaia iŋes tema, “Abu ayoŋ eŋolik ŋituŋa a Isirael daadaŋ ielar lokamukumukui ikwa ŋamesekin ŋuna emam ekeyokon, ido abu Ekapolon tema, ‘Mam lu ekapolon kec, itemokino ikes tolot ŋinituŋanan lore keŋ a ekisil.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema erwosit a Isirael neni a Yeosapat, “Pa mono akalimokinit ayoŋ iyoŋ atemar mam ŋakiro ŋuna ajokak ŋuna edwari iŋes aŋuna kaŋ mati ŋuna a ŋican bon a?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Mikaia neni keŋ, “Kiira ŋakiro ke Ekapolon nu, abu ayoŋ eŋolik Ekapolon iboi alokicoloŋ keŋ a ŋolo ka apedor, ewuasi ŋimalaikan ŋulu anakuj daadaŋ aloteten ka alokedyeny keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon, ‘Ŋae epedori amodiyar Aab erwosit a Isirael lojie, ikotere elosi toarae alo Ramos-Gilead?’ Tolimu nai emalaika epei ŋakiro ŋace, ido tolimu ece ŋace, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akitodol ŋina abunio etau kiŋaren towo alokiŋaren Ekapolon tema, ‘Amodiyari ayoŋ iŋes.’ Kiŋit Ekapolon iŋes tema, ‘Ikwaani?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok etau tema, ‘Alosi ayoŋ oinak ŋikadwarak ka Aab daadaŋ kirworo alyokonu.’ Tema Ekapolon, ‘Ape tomodiya iŋes. Ipedori iyoŋ amodiyar iŋes.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toŋetak Mikaia ŋakiro keŋ ebala, “Erae ŋakiro nu ŋuna atakanut, adau Ekapolon akituruwor ŋikadwarak kon ŋulu irworosi alyokonu neni kon. Nai alimu Ekapolon elope atemar iryamuni iyoŋ ŋican.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolot nai Sedekia lokoku a Kenaana neni a Mikaia kibap lokeli, kiŋit tema, “Ai etori etau ke Ekapolon aneni kaŋ ebuni akisirwor iyoŋ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok Mikaia iŋes tema, “Iyenuni iyoŋ ŋakiro nu akoloŋit ŋina ilosyo iyoŋ akiŋop nagule ŋina alokidiŋ akai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyarau nai erwosit a Isirael epei a ŋikapolok a akwap keŋ tema, “Ape ya Mikaia, kinyaka iŋes neni ka Amon a ekapolon a etaun ka neni a Yoas alokoku a erwosit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tolimok iyoŋ ikes atemar, ŋakiro ŋuna irworo erwosit ikes nu, ‘Kiwuakisi etuŋanan lo lojera, inanakis iŋes ŋamugati ka ŋakipi ŋadikudyo akitodol ŋina aboŋunio ayoŋ alojie emam ŋace.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Mikaia iŋes tema, “Ani kire kiboŋu iyoŋ alojie emam ŋace, iŋes atemar nyirworo Ekapolon neni kon aneni kaŋ.” Toropak iŋes erwor keŋ tema, “Kiirasi ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋakiro ŋuna adau ayoŋ alimun!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kilounae Aab ka toarae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu erwosit a Isirael ka Yeosapat erwosit a Yudaya kitipeiyosi Ramos-Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema erwosit a Isirael neni a Yeosapat, “Anapi ayoŋ etusubun ecaryoit alosi lojie, nai emaikina iyoŋ tonap ŋilowi kon ŋulu ka apolou.” Abu nai erwosit a Isirael tonap kitusubun ecaryoit, ido tolot lojie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, keris erwosit ka Aram kicik ŋikapolok a ŋasigarya keŋ ŋulu a ŋagaari a ŋuna iritae a ŋaŋolei ebe, “Nyilot akitijiore ituŋanan idio ŋinicaryoit, kori ŋini itopolooritae, nai kitijioto erwosit a Isirael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iŋolikinete ŋikapolok ŋulu ameto ŋagaari ŋuna eritae a ŋaŋolei ŋul Yeosapat, temasi, “Erae lo kire erwosit a Isirael.” Aŋun, apotu ikes toloto akitijiore Yeosapat; kiworou Yeosapat, kiŋarak Ekapolon iŋes, kitoboŋo Akuj ikes aneni a Yeosapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eyenunete ŋikapolok ŋul atemar meere ŋol erwosit a Isirael, apotu kimyekis akiwuapit Yeosapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai kebu esigarit epei ŋolo ka Aram topeto ekaleŋeleŋet keŋ, kicwanya Aab toŋicar aloboro keŋ aŋulu ke ejie a ŋulu anapit iŋes, togum iŋes. Tema erwosit neni a ekameton agaari keŋ, “Kibelekin, yaarae ayoŋ a lojie, anerae akawani ayoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tomwanu ejie nooi akoloŋit ŋin, torubak erwosit a Isirael iboi anagaari keŋ iŋoliyarit neni ayakasi Ŋiarameani akitodol eboŋ. Ani edoiyori akoloŋ, kiridak iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
